&lt;li&gt;Perform engineering calculations, system layouts, and equipment selections under the guidance of licensed engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and apply knowledge of electrical engineering principles, codes, standards, and industry best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize engineering and design software such as Revit, AutoCAD, or other electrical modeling and analysis tools.&lt;/li&gt;
